    intro: "Subscription box fulfillment is the recurring assembly and shipping of the same box to subscribers on a set cycle, covering kitting, custom inserts, storage between cycles, and returns. Delivery Group Inc. runs subscription box programs from its Northern Kentucky fulfillment center, kitting each box to spec and shipping the full cycle on your ship date.",
